WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.499
Jinsi ya kuandika milinganyo yenye mitajo

00:00.499 --> 00:01.920
Ninachotaka kufanya kwenye hii video

00:01.920 --> 00:06.000
ni kuandika milinganyo ya aljebra ambayo inawakilisha kitu sawa

00:06.000 --> 00:07.930
ambacho kinasemwa na hizi kauli.

00:07.930 --> 00:11.250
Hivyo hii kauli ya kwanza, inasema jumla ya hasi 7

00:11.250 --> 00:14.140
na 8 mara x.

00:14.140 --> 00:17.790
Hivyo jumla-- kwa hiyo tutakuwa na alama ya kujumlisha hapa--

00:17.790 --> 00:24.590
ya hasi 7 na 8 mara x.

00:24.590 --> 00:28.770
Hivyo 8 mara x, hiyo itakuwa 8x.

00:28.770 --> 00:30.790
Kwa hiyo naweza kuandika 8x hapa.

00:30.790 --> 00:33.750
Kwa hiyo ni hasi 7 jumlisha 8x.

00:33.750 --> 00:37.060
Au unaweza kuiangalia hii kama jumla ya hasi 7

00:37.060 --> 00:39.950
na 8 mara x.

00:39.950 --> 00:41.410
Hebu tufanye nyingine.

00:41.410 --> 00:49.165
Chukua hasi 3 mara x na kisha ongeza 1.

00:51.750 --> 00:54.410
Hivyo hasi 3 mara x,

00:54.410 --> 00:57.340
tunaweza kuandika kama hasi 3x.

00:57.340 --> 00:59.280
Na kisha tunahitaji kuongeza 1.

00:59.280 --> 01:03.240
Hivyo itakuwa jumlisha 1.

01:03.240 --> 01:04.239
Na sasa ni hii.

01:04.239 --> 01:08.760
Hasi 6 jumlisha-- tunaweza kuandika

01:08.760 --> 01:13.830
hasi 6 jumlisha kitu fulani-- zao la hasi 1 na x.

01:13.830 --> 01:17.060
Kwa hiyo zao la hasi 1 na x,

01:17.060 --> 01:20.410
itakuwa hasi 1x, ambayo

01:20.410 --> 01:22.710
ni sawa na hasi x.

01:22.710 --> 01:26.360
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kuandika hii kama hasi 6 jumlisha hasi x.

01:26.360 --> 01:28.260
Au tunaweza kuandika hii

01:28.260 --> 01:35.480
sawa na hasi 6 toa x.

01:35.480 --> 01:37.510
Na tumemaliza.
